     H*****************************************************************
     H*  SPECIAL FILE NOTES:                                          *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  THE FOLLOWING FILES/PROGRAMS MUST BE MODIFIED ANYTIME A NEW  *
     H*  FIELD IS ADDED TO WMRRP:                                     *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES IN THE      *
     H*    TEST ENVIRONMENT.                                          *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  - CLIENT 03: NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES  *
     H*    IN WPEACOCK                                                *
     H*                                                               *
     H*****************************************************************
     H*                                                               *
     H*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PRR01                     TEXT('REQUEST REFUND FILE')
     A            RRCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            RRFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            RRFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            RRCASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A            RRREQ#    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('REQUEST' 'NUMBER')
     A            RRFEIN    R               REFFLD(FEIN)
     A            RRMOD     R               REFFLD(MOD)
     A            RRRAMT    R               REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('REFUND AMT' 'REQUESTED')
     A            RRRCVD    R               REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('AMOUNT' 'RECOVERED')
     A            RRDTRC    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'REFUND' 'RECEIVED')
     A            RRDTRQ    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'REFUND' 'REQUESTED')
     A            RRDESC    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A                                      COLHDG('NOT USED')
     A            RRAFFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('NOT USED')
     A            RREPFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('NOT USED')
     A            RRMEFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('NOT USED')
     A            RRPEFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('NOT USED')
     A            RRCOM1    R               REFFLD(NM60)
     A                                      COLHDG('COMMENT 1')
     A            RRCOM2    R               REFFLD(NM60)
     A                                      COLHDG('COMMENT 2')
     A            RRSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            RRUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            RRPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            RRTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            RRDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            RRDTRE    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE REFUND FILED')
     A            RRSTCD    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('STATUS CODE')
     A            RRSTTP    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('STATUS TYPE')
     A            RRATTY    R               REFFLD(FEIN)
     A                                      COLHDG('ATTORNEY')
     A            RRAMOD    R               REFFLD(MOD)
     A                                      COLHDG('ATTORNEY MODIFIER')
